            "review_title": "Review at Nhau Nhau",
            "review_text": "Beppe Marini\nLeivi, Italy744 contributions\n0\nHigh-end venue for connoisseurs and refined customers\nOct 2025 • Couples\nMaybe a little hard to find on a street selling street food. Look for the Anan Saigon restaurant and go up to the Third party floor. You will find yourself in a cozy and elegant, romantic, softly lit bar that is very reminiscent of the clubs of old Saigon. In the seats along the counter and along the opposite wall you can enjoy cocktails, drinks or drinks expertly prepared by the talented bartender. Very professional and very prepared talking with her is a satisfaction also is ready to advise you to meet your requests. You can also eat in this place but I guess it's better to book. A place of excellence for refined customers and connoisseurs.\nRead more\nTranslated from Italian\nShow original\nWritten October 23, 2025",
